This work (all text, images, cover art, build scripts and generated
artifacts in this repository — the "Work") is licensed for EDUCATIONAL
and RESEARCH purposes only.

Subject to that limit, any person may, free of charge:
  1. read, download and reproduce the Work;
  2. distribute or quote it for personal study, teaching, or academic
     research, provided this license notice and attribution to the
     original authors are retained.

The following require the authors' prior written permission:
  • commercial use (sale, paid courses, ad revenue, commercial
    publishing, etc.);
  • repackaging the Work or substantial portions as a product or
    service for public distribution.

Notice:
  • NOT MEDICAL OR LEGAL ADVICE. The Work is not a professional
    medical, psychological, legal or educational opinion and must not
    replace the judgement of a physician, therapist, behaviour analyst,
    special-education teacher or lawyer. Anything concerning
    medication, treatment, assessment or legal procedure is subject to
    the treating physician's orders and to the law in force in the
    relevant year.
  • THE CASE IS DE-IDENTIFIED. In the main chapters the child appears
    under the alias "J". Identifiable names of people, schools,
    hospitals and dates are not contained in this repository.
    Appendix D is a blank template, not a record of any real case.
  • EVIDENCE LEVELS VARY. The strength of evidence behind each method
    is labelled per item in Appendix C and Appendix G. The stage
    sequence, metric design and material numbering are this book's
    editorial arrangement, not a validated protocol.
  • The Work is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. The
    authors are not liable for any damages arising from its use.

